You guys will go off to college, meet other pretty girls,

00:41:54.710 --> 00:41:57.710
and relationships that once seemed so important will just disappear.

00:41:59.290 --> 00:41:59.970
It's more complicated.

00:42:00.620 --> 00:42:03.860
It always seems like that.

00:42:05.600 --> 00:42:14.120
At the end of the day, it comes down to what you can talk to, Missy, is about honesty.

00:42:15.410 --> 00:42:20.490
And over the course of relationships, you realize that people really don't tell you the truth.

00:42:21.120 --> 00:42:21.860
I'm content.

00:42:22.270 --> 00:42:25.950
After a few years, you're left with a choice.

00:42:30.000 --> 00:42:35.690
leave and be alone, or you can stay and be lonely.

00:42:49.660 --> 00:42:50.220
Are you okay?

00:42:53.470 --> 00:42:57.500
Do your friends who are in serious relationships cheat?

00:42:58.550 --> 00:42:59.790
Not the ones whose girlfriends

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:00.900
of treating them right.

00:43:01.510 --> 00:43:02.510
And what does that mean?

00:43:03.410 --> 00:43:06.430
Guys like a little kink, a little variety.

00:43:08.740 --> 00:43:12.080
Girls who think they can just spread their legs

00:43:12.080 --> 00:43:15.890
and think about the queen always get cheated on.

00:43:21.960 --> 00:43:23.980
Dr. Fitzpain having an affair?

00:43:24.430 --> 00:43:27.040
No, I don't know.

00:43:31.050 --> 00:43:32.810
I shouldn't be talking to you about this.

00:43:38.600 --> 00:43:39.680
What the hell are you wearing?

00:43:39.700 --> 00:43:42.500
It's for the Fromm's costume party.

00:43:45.290 --> 00:43:49.360
Your tie looks terrible. Let me, uh, fix that for you.

00:43:57.140 --> 00:43:59.980
He isn't fulfilling his husbandly obligations to you.

00:44:00.000 --> 00:44:28.540
anymore is he we're not talking about this you know beckett you gotta leave beckett leave

00:44:32.590 --> 00:44:33.350
Why?

00:44:35.320 --> 00:44:38.580
Because I'm about to become someone I don't like much.

00:44:41.130 --> 00:44:41.290
Babe!

00:44:59.060 --> 00:44:59.920
You say something to her.

00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:00.920
Did you say something to mom?

00:45:02.950 --> 00:45:05.560
Look son, I know how you feel about your mother.

00:45:06.260 --> 00:45:08.120
You've always had the need to be your champion.

00:45:08.360 --> 00:45:09.940
Probably because I never was.

00:45:10.380 --> 00:45:12.480
But you need to let me handle this in my own way

00:45:12.480 --> 00:45:13.640
and on my own timetable.

00:45:16.020 --> 00:45:17.660
This is the blood work on Mario Wallace.

00:45:19.300 --> 00:45:21.200
Looks like you're gonna have to do her hysterectomy

00:45:21.200 --> 00:45:21.780
after all.

00:45:52.200 --> 00:45:57.080
Townie kids come around last night. Hate always finds a way.

00:46:00.320 --> 00:46:07.820
Can I have a minute? Where's Christina?

00:46:08.980 --> 00:46:10.940
I seen her shopping, she was so upset.

00:46:15.520 --> 00:46:17.840
You came here to tell me you're not doing my surgery, right?

00:46:21.670 --> 00:46:25.070
I am to do your surgery.

00:46:27.010 --> 00:46:28.710
Invasive kind that we discussed.

00:46:29.580 --> 00:46:29.980
Grr.

00:46:30.000 --> 00:46:31.580
Great. Good. That's what I wanted.

00:46:32.120 --> 00:46:36.750
When I did your pre-op blood work, I ordered a CA-125 test.

00:46:36.910 --> 00:46:38.660
It's a polypeptide test.

00:46:40.120 --> 00:46:43.080
A normal score for a healthy person is below 25.

00:46:44.620 --> 00:46:45.760
Your number was 85.

00:46:47.460 --> 00:46:48.160
Which means?

00:46:49.730 --> 00:46:51.150
You have ovarian cancer.

00:47:00.640 --> 00:47:01.380
How bad is it?

00:47:02.110 --> 00:47:04.510
Those numbers suggest stage three, maybe stage four.

00:47:08.220 --> 00:47:08.900
Which means I'm dying.

00:47:14.180 --> 00:47:19.940
But my kids, they're so young, they haven't even gotten to know me yet.

00:47:22.400 --> 00:47:24.000
Who's going to take care of Christina?

00:47:25.280 --> 00:47:27.140
We'll do the exploratory surgery first.

00:47:31.440 --> 00:47:32.480
This is all my fault.

