You're not the third gynecologist I've been to.

00:47:46.020 --> 00:47:46.960
You're the first.

00:47:50.010 --> 00:47:57.040
I've been bleeding for months, but I was too embarrassed to go see someone.

00:48:00.000 --> 00:48:03.990
I hated the thought of me sitting in that waiting room

00:48:03.990 --> 00:48:08.340
and all those pretty women around just judging me

00:48:08.340 --> 00:48:10.180
and hating me for who I was.

00:48:12.330 --> 00:48:19.230
I hate to be honest with other people

00:48:19.230 --> 00:48:21.740
and to be honest with myself.

00:48:23.650 --> 00:48:24.750
I waited too long.

00:48:30.960 --> 00:48:32.240
Are treatments available?

00:48:32.540 --> 00:48:37.160
I'm going to make sure you get them all until we find something that works.

00:48:40.880 --> 00:48:42.580
Why are you being so nice to me?

00:49:03.420 --> 00:49:04.620
What happened to you last night, Patrick?

00:49:05.300 --> 00:49:05.740
I'm sorry.

00:49:06.330 --> 00:49:07.130
Cassie got sick.

00:49:07.210 --> 00:49:08.530
Some kind of stomach thing.

00:49:12.480 --> 00:49:16.110
Should have caused everybody looking at it.

00:49:17.070 --> 00:49:18.530
Oliver finally filled his tank.

00:49:23.780 --> 00:49:24.260
See horses?

00:49:25.250 --> 00:49:29.970
Only 45 for the 442 families of bony fish exhibit parental care.

00:49:31.310 --> 00:49:36.330
But the male seahorse is the only one who actually fertilizes and carries their offspring.

00:49:36.970 --> 00:49:37.850
Sounds good to me.

00:49:39.000 --> 00:49:42.880
So the chick seahorse does the guy, and the guy carries and has the babies?

00:49:43.540 --> 00:49:43.940
Exactly.

00:49:44.470 --> 00:49:47.550
So why don't you just call the chick seahorse the guy and the guy seahorse the chick?

00:49:48.900 --> 00:49:51.960
Because nature, at its best, is complicated.

00:50:08.760 --> 00:50:09.660
This is my stop.
